        "quotedText": "4.1 If the Administrator, in its use or receipt of the Services, does not have the ability to correct, amend, block or delete Personal Data, as required by Data Protection Legislation, Alaio will (taking into account the nature of the processing of Personal Data and, if applicable, Article 11 of the GDPR) assist Administrator in fulfilling any obligation of Administrator to respond to requests by data subjects, including (if applicable) Administrator´s  obligation to respond to requests for exercising the data sub ject's rights laid down in Chapter III of the GDPR and other Data Protection Legislation, by providing the functionality of the Processor Services;",
